## How to use this

1. For each row, identify the policy, procedure, or physical control that
   satisfies it, and reference it in the System Security Plan (03.15.02).
2. Where no control exists yet, open a POA&M item (03.12.02).
3. Review the parameter values above at the frequency set for 03.12.01
   ({{ (org_odp | selectattr('id', 'equalto', 'assess_freq') | first).value
      | default('as your organization requires', true) }}). They are defaults
   drawn from common DoD CUI practice, not your organization's decisions,
   until someone has reviewed them.
